Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gothic structure began its\Nlife as a 14th century castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Converted into a hotel in the early 1900s,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it closed 10 years ago\Nwhen the owner died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Kars is using the ancient\Nbuilding as a shelter from the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lurks within, waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, JoJo and Lisa Lisa know\Nnothing of the hotel's layout.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.30,0:00:40.77,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.30,0:00:40.77,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.61,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.61,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.61,0:00:47.99,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.61,0:00:47.99,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.24,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:55.24,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.99,0:01:01.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.99,0:01:01.79,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.99,0:01:01.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.79,0:01:10.51,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.79,0:01:10.51,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.51,0:01:16.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.51,0:01:16.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.39,0:01:23.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.39,0:01:23.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.23,0:01:27.07,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.23,0:01:27.07,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.07,0:01:32.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.07,0:01:32.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.32,0:01:35.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.32,0:01:35.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.83,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.83,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.83,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.83,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.83,0:01:41.66,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.83,0:01:41.66,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.66,0:01:47.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.66,0:01:47.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.46,0:01:52.51,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.46,0:01:52.51,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
