Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really would it kill you to sweep a bit\Nokay I get it scary monsters don't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much house cleaning but that does leave\Nevidence see this blood trail it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As though Wamuu took a good hum on\Nthrashing Caesar didn't go down without.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving a good account of himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We mustn't let Wamuu heal anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coach Lisa Lisa, it's\Ntime for some action!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, when I took a hold of this\Ndoorknob, it wasn't pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like I was grabbing the\Nhand of something cold and dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the door! Where's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a door, but I am here! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's... that's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:02:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for your little Yuya there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would've peeled your\Nface right off your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Wyatt Beck and\NI'll be slaying you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed my sweetheart, but\Nthen I busted out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In no time, Lord Kars took me in\Nand made me part of his little gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got my loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to let\Nyou go in there and disturb
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Kars when he's enjoying\Na well-deserved rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they've done it. It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've started unleashing their\Ndemon hounds on the weak and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just another vampire who's\Nbound for hell and leaving now.
