Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful, magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skin is so soft, heavenly, and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me hold you, and then I'll drink\Nyour life right through that skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really not impressing me. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to waste my time listening to\Nyour weak flirtations and shallow threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you want to hold me,\Ngo ahead and give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it'll be the\Nlast thing that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's covered top to bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're popping out of him like\Nhundreds of pointed fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're metallic and racist\Nsharp, like an Iron Maiden jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate it when stuck-up\Nfemales are insulting like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a nice squeeze!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.40,0:04:53.44,SFXYellow,3,0,0,0,,{=25}{\blur9\bord4.3\fscx64.52\fscy53.76\1a&H00&\3a&H80&\frz11.71\pos(770.24,360.42)\alpha&H80&}Dash
