Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her scarf becomes a hormone-filled\Nweapon with incredibly long reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, thanks for the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Jojo, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa's movements, they're\Neffortless and flow like silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Efficient, she doesn't waste any energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, you can't just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree that a woman who\Nbehaves like that needs to be punished?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you are the one being punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, you've just run out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon is now running\Nall through your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, I'm not. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, Lisa has really got what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought she might be out\Nof her depth in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's plainly obvious\Nshe's even better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to have her training me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you taken it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't delay any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must use the antidote! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to drink it\Nonly after I defeat Wamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See this ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It no longer signifies a\Npromise between me and Wamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now a promise I make to Caesar, that\NI will go on living and stay in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please hold it for me\Nuntil I actually need it, Lisa-Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be better if it stayed with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows what might happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As they ventured further into the depths,\Nthe trail of blood grew ever thinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both Jojo and Lisa Lisa knew well what\Nmeaning could be drawn from that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu's Hamon wounds were healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your powers have grown greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who killed Caesar! Now I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool your head, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look at the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm in control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the footprints, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means Kars is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where I can fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show your cowardly self now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, there are two sets\Nof footprints. He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I feel dozens of lungs moving\Nthe air around as well. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are extremely composed and perceptive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though you are a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see how Jojo and\NCaesar we're able to learn so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much so quickly and you can feel\Neven the lightest? respiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rank among the\Nfinest Hormone warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd guess you're all\Nvampires, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No response.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's creepy too.
