Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Khaas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Khaas saw fit to give us, his\Nchosen ones, the gift of eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We, number a hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on our master's order, we'll tear you both\Nto shreds, a hundred against two! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hundred of them\Nagainst the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Kars, a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in Rome, Jojo and I promised\Nto fight one another again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want revenge for ACDC.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow me the chance to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that my goal is only\Nto obtain the Red Stone of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn. No fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not in the mood anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we both know I would beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to what end?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All these vampires are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of motivation\Nis that, I ask you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win or lose, I would still\Ncome out of it dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With odds like that, giving up\Nis the only rational choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm throwing in the towel.
