Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you were watching all the\Ntime, a Hamonet was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill them without any further delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you kill us, you'll\Nnever get the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying now, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think I'd have\Nthe stone here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be wise, now would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're headed to our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're not there in\Ntime to set the device,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the red stone will be destroyed\Nand you will have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look woman don't try to\Nfool me are you confident
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you and your minions\Nwill be able to find
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it in time the ball my\Nset is a very small one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but enough to damage the\Nstone and prevent its use
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could this really be true she\Nnever said anything whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll follow her lead were\NAre you fellows listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't stop it,\Nthe bomb will go boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if true, we cannot\Nlet you leave here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo and Mwabu can have\Ntheir fight one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kaz, you and I will\Nalso fight one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those who are left standing\Nwill possess the stone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winners of this fight will have\Nthe red stone and all of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be made very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of us will prove strong\Nenough to wield the stone's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is fit to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pillowmen or humankind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Kars, this is most absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just proven herself to be a better\Ngambler than I could ever dream of being.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do have pluck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we will battle for the\Nstone, but don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using only words she just turned a dire\Nsituation into more or less even odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so now we need to arrange a\Ntime and place for our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu, what are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fight tonight under\Nthe gaze of the full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arena at the base of Piz Bernina,\N15 kilometers to the southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will meet at the Skeleton's\NHeel Stone Circle there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many warriors have found death, glory, or\Nboth throughout the history of that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a stone circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just choose a place\Nbecause it happens to suit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Wamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that to be a fine choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's speak of the Red Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will bring the Redstone of Asia to\Nthe Skeleton's Heel at midnight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to remove the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The woman will remain\Nhere with us as insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Lisa, Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want to make sure that we\Ndon't run away from the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a reasonable request.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, go and fetch us the Red Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you back at the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until yesterday, I lived my\Nlife thinking only about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now there's a new intense\Nfeeling burning up inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this compassion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I just want to destroy\Nthose bastards and all their line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Caesar and for Machina too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, Lisa, and for everyone else I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, there's no bomb here\Nor anywhere else for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa Lisa, even when you're under pressure,\Nyou are one deceptive young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, maybe I should bring you a\Nchange of panties in case you get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Granny Arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would Lisa Lisa be\Ndoing with this? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May Knight, 1889?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that young guy there is Speedwagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Granny Arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that straightzo, holding a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, Lisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about your past or\Nthe life you have led or who you've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly be\Ndoing with these photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
