Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's genuine we accept your proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we honor you by fighting one-on-one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose this means you saw the photos,\Nand you'd like to talk about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I had intended to\Ndiscuss this with you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start with who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifty years ago now, Iran lost her\Nhusband on a ship sailing the Atlantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was Jonathan Joestar, your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That horrible day, your grandmother\Nsaved the life of a baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the baby in that photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you were a baby 50 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how old are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're 50?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:18:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, if you're 50, that\Nmeans then you're really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, you look like\Nyou're in your late 20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say that harmon energy is\Nlife energy and keeps you young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that explains why you really don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,act like a young woman\Nwould behave at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I think I see a little\Nwrinkle back there. Yep.
