Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vampires, prepare the arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is not enough\Ntime for us to talk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we really do need to find the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because our roots are deeply connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our roots?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone mask killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iran was pregnant when she rescued\Nthe little girl on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She couldn't raise two children,\Nso Straitzo became a father to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzo as a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I know about\NHarmon, Straitzo taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even gave me the red stone of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is all just so\Nunbelievable and hard to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tragic beyond words\Nthat the fear of growing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,old drove him to commit\Nsuch acts of madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, my feelings about you defeating\Nhim are extremely complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I believe that it was destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is there to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything, all of it, is so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bizarre relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She carries with her a\Npast painted by sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of it will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that rumbling noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle can begin now. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many of\Nyou get crushed! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing? A dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I think a horse! That's a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Kars! Lord Wamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got Berserk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord WAMU, PLEASE!
