Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, these are fine steeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone masks worked extremely well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're now strong vampires. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vampire horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On that track,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo and Wamuu will face each other one-on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-one in a fierce\Nancient-style chariot duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ancient Roman-style deathmatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will battle, racing around the\Narena trying to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wamuu or Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who will be the first\None to fall under the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wheels or get beaten down by his opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loser dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dies those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo the beasts have a hundred times\Nnormal strength even lord Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can barely control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight you on any\Nfield or in any cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But vampires are your minions even horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how is that fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fret human the reins you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will conduct hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu will use his superior strength\Nand you can use your hamon to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look pretty vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, they're mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true, but a\Nlittle hormone does help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu, Wamuu, Wamuu, Wamuu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.46,0:22:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu, Wamuu, Wamuu, Wamuu, Wamuu!
