Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Wamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has chosen an ancient\Nform for this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a sign he means to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not going into this\Nfor the sport of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to take your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just beat him, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no draws.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you notice that I haven't\Ntaken this antidote yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to Caesar that I wouldn't\Ndrink this until after I took you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:23:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That promise is going to provide me with\Na power I've never experienced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll face this fight together, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.40,0:23:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's ride into battle!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.11,0:23:50.58,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Along the drifting cloud, the eagle searching down on the land
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.12,0:23:57.62,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Catching the swirling wind, the sailor sees the rim of the land
Dialogue: 1,0:23:59.25,0:24:04.80,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The eagle's dancing wings create, as weather spins out of hand
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.69,0:24:26.19,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Go closer hold the land, feel partly no more than grains of sand
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.90,0:24:33.24,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,We stand to lose all time, a thousand answers by in our hand
Dialogue: 1,0:24:35.04,0:24:40.63,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Next to your deeper fears, we stand surrounded by million years
Dialogue: 1,0:24:41.29,0:24:44.92,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the round and out, the\Nbirds will make you one and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.92,0:24:48.47,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.47,0:24:52.14,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the round and out,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the birds will make you one and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.14,0:24:56.06,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out
